<title>USA: Zaxis names John Danis as CEO.</title>
<headline>Zaxis names John Danis as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>HUDSON, Ohio 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zaxis International Inc said on Wednesday it named John Danis as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Danis will replace Bud Leffler, who resigned to pursue other business interests, it said.  </p>
<p>The company said Danis served as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Zaxis specializes in the development, production and marketing of applications for its elastomeric hydrophilic polymer technology like the separation of genes and other clinical research.</p>
